{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600040","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:1:1760004001:0":{"text":"ライカとブライアンに別れを告げ、あなたたちはその夜のうちに荒涼の砂漠へ急いだ……","source_cn":"告别了莱卡与布莱恩，你们连夜赶往荒角沙漠……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5EBCF1298C02FC2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ライカとブライアンに別れを告げ、あなたたちはその夜のうちに荒涼の砂漠へ急いだ……","female":"ライカとブライアンに別れを告げ、あなたたちはその夜のうちに荒涼の砂漠へ急いだ……","variant_male_record_index":"238153","variant_female_record_index":"238154","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760004002:0":{"text":"あっつ……やっぱり砂漠は暑いなあ。","source_cn":"好……热！不愧是沙漠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEE72B723876346C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760004003:0":{"text":"耳や尻尾が生えてる人がいっぱい、鋭い爪も……あの人たちもヴェルディア人なのか？","source_cn":"周围有好多长着耳朵、尾巴和爪子的人……那些人也是绿裔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35EAA208A3EDC5B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1760004003":{"text":"耳や尻尾が生えてる人がいっぱい、鋭い爪も……あの人たちもヴェルディア人なのか？","source_cn":"周围有好多长着耳朵、尾巴和爪子的人……那些人也是绿裔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35EAA208A3EDC5B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1760004004:0":{"text":"へえ……でも、こんなに人が多いと、アグモンを見つけるのは難しそうだな。","source_cn":"原来是这样。但这里有这么多人，要想找到亚古兽恐怕会有些困难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61AAF0875701